    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "An informant's tip with matching documents exposed the leak, leading the government organization to launch an investigation initiation. The law enforcement agency then made arrests, apprehending the wrongdoers including an arrested coaching figure. This event outcome saw the cancellation of the exam, and a planned re-examination was scheduled for June 21, providing a rescheduled examination for students.",
